PS5LM: context_status, save_handoff and load_handoff tools: the model sees how full its context is (after each remote_command result, and past LLAMA_HANDOFF_AT percent after every tool result) and saves handoff notes by name, in LLAMA_HANDOFF_DIR (default: a handoffs folder beside LLAMA_HANDOFF_PATH, whose single note is moved in), for later conversations. GET /tools?list=handoffs lists them for the web UI, and GET /tools?handoff=<name> shows one as a page.

